    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE - Game is currently being reworked, there will be no more updates until rerelease, which all progress will be reset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon the world will be engulfed in Gehenna. If the world is already in chaos, what will happen when that time comes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the guild leader, recruit allies to join your guild and fight against all the destruction that is present, so that you will be ready when it arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn Based RPG<br>Recruit characters with unique abilities (Featured resets weekly)<br>Quick clear resource stages with energy <br>Online PVP (now disabled)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day resets UTC+0, Week resets Sunday</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note some features require main story stages to be completed to be unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In app purchases are now disabled, please do not purchase anything via cash</p>",
